\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par    1.  \cf0   I will leave not my Jesus,
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0\qj for, He gave His life for my sake.
\par Therefore, it hehoves me to
\par give my flesh and heart to Jesus.
\par Christ the Saviour is my Lord,
\par I will leave not my Jesus.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par      2.  The world and its wealth in it,
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0\qj my heart desires not for these.
\par Jesus who has saved my life
\par gives me all the wealth I so need.
\par For my thanks and for His love,
\par I will leave not my Jesus.
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b 
\par \'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.   I will leave not my Jesus;\tab 
\par who can ever love me than Him?
\par Peacefulness and joyfulness,
\par Him alone shall I find all these.
\par Satisfaction, happiness
\par \pard    and eternal peace in Him.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

